        "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sayan\">@sayan</a>, Can you please help me with the following question.</p>\n<p>Write a script that will remove the outer rectangle and grow the inner rectangle to the exact size of outer rectangle and the inner rectangle region should be replaced with ‘0’ (zero) including the boundary line.</p>\n<p>I could do till <code>sed 's/x/0/g' | sed 's/*/x/g'</code>. This replaced the outer and inner rectangles but I could not fill the spaces with 0s.</p>\n<p>Please guide.</p>",
